1.0.3 2026-10-30

  - events.tsv (all 20 subjects): seven columns added from the source table D.stimuliValues, verbatim and in trial
    order: three operand columns (N1, N2, N3), two operator columns (O1, O2), the response time RT (s) and
    stimType; described in events.json. Existing columns and rows unchanged.
  - README: the published text is kept unchanged; paragraphs added after it describe the new columns (the earlier
    statement that stimuliValues could not be decoded is superseded).
  - code/fix-20261030_stimuliValues_to_events.py: the conversion script.

